{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel were fruitful and swarmed.</b> To fulfill what HaShem said: 'Fear not to go down to Egypt, for there I will make you a great nation.'" "<b>And the land was filled with them.</b> Like 'from them.' That is, the land was filled from them, for the word אותם is derived from את, as it is written 'אותו ואת בנו,' and we find את serving in the sense of מן, 'כצאתי את העיר,' 'חלה את רגליו.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:39.524871472Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}